5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is lovely to see us all here. I hope we can find a service that truly lasts and doesn't falter when things get difficult.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree. We should consider who is actually able to reach us, and if our current locations are creating invisible barriers for some.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,We shouldn't just guess! We have old records of things we tried before. Why aren't we looking at those first?,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,Rin makes a fair point. Logic suggests that historical data is more reliable than our current intuitions. We must also ensure the funding is sustainable.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,"Sustainability includes people, not just money. We need to know if we have the actual skills on staff to manage these new commitments.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Jonathan, that is very thoughtful. I worry about things we cannot control, like the weather or outside schedules, disrupting our kindness.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"Exactly. If the bus lines have changed, a beautiful new program in the main building is useless to those in the outer wards.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,I want to see what happened with the old programs! Maybe they failed for a reason we can fix now.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,I am interested in the specific terms of our grants. A large sum today is a tragedy if it vanishes by year two.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minako,,I will look into our volunteer and staff capabilities. We cannot simply assume someone knows how to supervise a new technical service.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I think I shall look into the road closures and the grant terms to see where we are vulnerable.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I will investigate the bus links and the evening room bookings to understand the current gaps in access.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,I'm picking the two programmes from six years ago and the old outreach attendance sheets!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"I will examine the running and equipment lines from last year, as well as the grant terms and endowment.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minako,,"I'll check the volunteer register and supervision training, and the neighbourhood associations and tool certification.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
